---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import SiteFrame from "../components/SiteFrame.astro";
import { CV_FILES } from "../utils/cv";
---
<Base title="About · Rodrigo Villalba" description="Rodrigo Villalba, Senior Full Stack Developer from Paraguay with over 16 years building software. TypeScript, React, Node.js and Java/Spring.">
  <SiteFrame>
    <main class="prose">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <h2>Who is Rodrigo Villalba?</h2>
      <p>A Senior Full Stack Developer from Paraguay, building software for over 16 years. TypeScript, React, Node.js and Java/Spring Boot, from the database to the UI.</p>
      <h2>So, tell me more about this guy</h2>
      <p>Rodrigo is a software engineer currently working at <a href="https://www.sodep.com.py" rel="noopener">Sodep</a> as a Senior Full Stack Developer. He graduated from Católica University in Asunción with a Computer Engineering degree, which for him is only a fancy label that allows him to trick people into believing that he actually knows what he is doing.</p>
      <h3>Technical interests</h3>
      <p>Rodrigo has a lot of technical interests, his main focus being TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, Java with Spring Boot, AWS and, lately, building with AI coding agents without losing control of the code.</p>
      <p>He considers himself proficient at technical writing, teaching and mentoring, and also likes writing blog posts where he talks about himself in third person.</p>
      <p>Code quality is also a special interest of him, and anything that is related to that subject, like applying refactoring techniques, thinking about design principles, and solving complex architecture problems.</p>
      <h2>Non-technical interests</h2>
      <p>When he is not being technical, Rodrigo enjoys spending time running, meditating and reading. His favorite type of books are the mind expanding ones and memoirs.</p>
      <p>He also loves playing the guitar and watching movies and TV shows.</p>
      <h2 id="curriculum">Curriculum</h2>
      <ul class="cv-block">
        {CV_FILES.map((cv) => (
          <li>
            {cv.label}: <a href={cv.path} hreflang={cv.lang}>Ver PDF</a> · <a href={cv.path} download>Descargar</a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
      <p>That is it for now, if you want to get in touch with Rodrigo, the best way to reach out to him is via <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/rojv/" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></p>
      <p>Cheers! ❤️</p>
    </main>
  </SiteFrame>
</Base>
